## Input

```css
@supports (display: grid) {
  .declaration {
    display: grid;
  }
}

@supports (display: grid) and (not (color: red)) {
  .logical {
    display: grid;
  }
}

@supports selector(.selector-control) {
  .selector-control {
    display: grid;
  }
}

@supports func(10, 20, 40) {
  .general-enclosed-function {
    display: grid;
  }
}

